//! `packs/<pack>/generated/*.rs`: a pack's GRL rules compiled to Rust modules (packs-and-plugins.md 6.1).
//!
//! The std pack runs against the gob host; the crunk-core pack runs against the crunk host and
//! types its `config.*` relations from `docs/schemas/crunk.json`. The generated module is host
//! independent (it takes the executor's `Input` and `Relations`), so a pack only names its own
//! source and output directories and, optionally, the config schema its rules are checked against.
//!
//! Never a build script: the modules are checked in, regenerated by `cargo dev gen std-rules` and
//! byte-compared by GEN001. Each module forbids `unsafe` and sits under a grimble node that holds
//! no grants (`design/model.grmb`), so any ambient effect in it is CAP001.

